<p>A calculator for working out your path to Financial Independence, built for UK and/or Australian residents. It handles the different pension access ages and tax-advantaged accounts in each country, and treats housing as a first-class part of the plan: to be <em>truly</em> financially independent, you need to control the place you live in.</p>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/fire-calculator.css">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

<div id="fire-calculator">
  <!-- Country Selection -->
  <div class="calc-section">
    <h3>Where are your finances?</h3>
    <div class="radio-group country-selector">
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="country" value="uk" checked>
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        UK Only
      </label>
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="country" value="au">
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        Australia Only
      </label>
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="country" value="both">
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        Both Countries
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Currency Selection (shown for "both" mode) -->
  <div class="calc-section currency-section" id="currency-section" style="display: none;">
    <h3>Display Currency</h3>
    <div class="radio-group">
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="currency" value="GBP" checked>
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        GBP (£)
      </label>
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="currency" value="AUD">
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        AUD ($)
      </label>
    </div>
    <p class="exchange-rate-info">
      Exchange rate: <span id="exchange-rate-display">Loading...</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Personal Details -->
  <div class="calc-section">
    <h3>About You</h3>
    <div class="input-grid-3">
      <div class="input-group">
        <label for="current-age">Current Age</label>
        <input type="number" id="current-age" value="35" min="18" max="80">
      </div>
      <div class="input-group">
        <label for="fire-age">Target FIRE Age</label>
        <input type="number" id="fire-age" value="50" min="25" max="80">
      </div>
      <div class="input-group">
        <label for="annual-spending">Retirement Spending p.a.</label>
        <div class="input-with-prefix">
          <span class="currency-prefix" id="spending-currency">£</span>
          <input type="number" id="annual-spending" value="40000" min="0" step="1000">
        </div>
        <p class="input-helper">Excludes housing costs &mdash; set those below.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Housing -->
  <div class="calc-section">
    <h3>Housing</h3>
    <p class="section-note">To be truly financially independent you need somewhere to live that you control. Your retirement spending above <strong>excludes</strong> housing &mdash; pick your situation here and the calculator adds the right cost on top.</p>
    <div class="radio-group housing-selector">
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="housing" value="own" checked>
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        Own outright
      </label>
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="housing" value="mortgage">
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        Mortgaged
      </label>
      <label class="radio-label">
        <input type="radio" name="housing" value="rent">
        <span class="radio-custom"></span>
        Renting
      </label>
    </div>

    <p class="input-helper" id="housing-own-note">You own your home outright, so no housing costs are added to your retirement spending.</p>

    <div class="housing-fields" id="housing-mortgage-fields" style="display: none;">
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="mortgage-payment">Monthly Mortgage Payment</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix housing-currency">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="mortgage-payment" value="1200" min="0" step="100">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="mortgage-years">Years Until Paid Off</label>
          <input type="number" id="mortgage-years" value="20" min="0" max="50">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="input-helper">A fixed mortgage payment doesn't rise with inflation and stops once the loan is repaid.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="housing-fields" id="housing-rent-fields" style="display: none;">
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="rent-payment">Monthly Rent</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix housing-currency">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="rent-payment" value="1500" min="0" step="100">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="input-helper">Rent rises with inflation and never ends, so renters need a larger pot than owners.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- UK Accounts -->
  <div class="calc-section uk-section" id="uk-section">
    <h3>UK Accounts</h3>
    <p class="section-note" id="uk-pension-note">Private pension accessible at age <strong id="uk-pension-age-display">57</strong>. ISA funds accessible anytime.</p>
    
    <div class="account-group">
      <h4>Pension (Workplace/SIPP)</h4>
      <p class="input-helper">Include: workplace pension, SIPP, personal pensions</p>
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="uk-pension-balance">Current Balance</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="uk-pension-balance" value="50000" min="0" step="1000">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="uk-pension-contribution">Annual Contribution</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="uk-pension-contribution" value="12000" min="0" step="500">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="account-group">
      <h4>ISA & Accessible Savings</h4>
      <p class="input-helper">Include: ISA balances, premium bonds, savings accounts, crypto</p>
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="uk-isa-balance">Current Balance</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="uk-isa-balance" value="30000" min="0" step="1000">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="uk-isa-contribution">Annual Contribution</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">£</span>
            <input type="number" id="uk-isa-contribution" value="10000" min="0" step="500">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Australia Accounts -->
  <div class="calc-section au-section" id="au-section" style="display: none;">
    <h3>Australian Accounts</h3>
    <p class="section-note">Superannuation accessible at preservation age <strong>60</strong>. Other savings accessible anytime.</p>
    
    <div class="account-group">
      <h4>Superannuation</h4>
      <p class="input-helper">Include: all superannuation accounts</p>
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="au-super-balance">Current Balance</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">$</span>
            <input type="number" id="au-super-balance" value="100000" min="0" step="1000">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="au-super-contribution">Annual Contribution</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">$</span>
            <input type="number" id="au-super-contribution" value="15000" min="0" step="500">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="account-group">
      <h4>Other Investments</h4>
      <p class="input-helper">Include: shares, ETFs, investment property equity, crypto, savings accounts, alternative investments</p>
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="au-savings-balance">Current Balance</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">$</span>
            <input type="number" id="au-savings-balance" value="50000" min="0" step="1000">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="input-group">
          <label for="au-savings-contribution">Annual Contribution</label>
          <div class="input-with-prefix">
            <span class="currency-prefix">$</span>
            <input type="number" id="au-savings-contribution" value="20000" min="0" step="500">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Assumptions -->
  <div class="calc-section">
    <h3>Assumptions</h3>
    <div class="input-grid">
      <div class="input-group">
        <label for="return-rate">Expected Return (% p.a.)</label>
        <input type="number" id="return-rate" value="7" min="0" max="15" step="0.5">
      </div>
      <div class="input-group">
        <label for="inflation-rate">Inflation (% p.a.)</label>
        <input type="number" id="inflation-rate" value="2.5" min="0" max="10" step="0.5">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Calculate Button -->
  <div class="calc-section">
    <button type="button" id="calculate-btn" class="btn-primary">Calculate FIRE Plan</button>
  </div>

  <!-- Results -->
  <div class="calc-section results-section" id="results-section" style="display: none;">
    <h3>Your FIRE Plan</h3>
    
    <div class="results-summary" id="results-summary">
      <!-- Filled by JavaScript -->
    </div>

    <div class="chart-container">
      <h4>Net Worth Over Time</h4>
      <canvas id="available-chart"></canvas>
    </div>

    <div class="breakdown-table-container" id="breakdown-table-container">
      <!-- Filled by JavaScript -->
    </div>

    <div class="liquidity-analysis" id="liquidity-analysis">
      <!-- Filled by JavaScript -->
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="disclaimer">
    <p><strong>Assumptions &amp; caveats:</strong> Contributions are held flat in nominal terms (they don't rise with inflation), so a long accumulation phase is modelled conservatively. Withdrawals and balances are shown <strong>pre-tax</strong> &mdash; UK pension and Australian super drawdowns in particular are taxed on the way out. A single spot exchange rate is applied across the whole projection. This is a planning tool, not financial advice.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<script src="/js/fire-calculator.js"></script>
